---
import Star from '../ui/Star.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section class="excellence section-padding" id="excellence" aria-labelledby="excellence-title">
  <div class="container ex-grid">
    <div class="ex-copy">
      <p class="kicker" data-i18n="home.excellence.label">The honorary street name</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="excellence-title">
        <span data-i18n="home.excellence.title_1">Excellence from</span>
        <span class="accent" data-i18n="home.excellence.title_2">Waukegan.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="home.excellence.p1">In July 2024, Waukegan dedicated the honorary street name "Shakedia Jones Olympic Way" on George Avenue, near her childhood home. That August, the City Council honored her with a proclamation.</p>

      <blockquote class="card-gold ex-quote">
        <Star class="ex-quote-star" />
        <p class="quote-text" lang="en" data-i18n="home.excellence.quote">“Why isn't there a place where we can go to find out the people in Waukegan who have done amazing things...”</p>
        <p class="tr-line" data-i18n="home.excellence.quote_tr"></p>
        <footer data-i18n="home.excellence.quote_cite">Shakedia Jones, Waukegan City Council, August 2024</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <p class="ex-p2" data-i18n="home.excellence.p2">She asked the city to give that place a home, so people can see excellence from Waukegan. She was asking for the next kid on the block, the one who needs to see that champions come from here. That is the job she wants: making excellence ordinary in the 1st Ward.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ex-visual">
      <div class="ex-honor bg-purple">
        <Star class="ex-honor-star" />
        <p class="ex-honor-name" data-i18n="home.excellence.tile_name">Shakedia Jones Olympic Way</p>
        <p class="ex-honor-line" data-i18n="home.excellence.tile_line">Honorary street name on George Avenue</p>
        <p class="ex-honor-date" data-i18n="home.excellence.tile_date">Dedicated July 14, 2024</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="ex-still photo">
        <img src={`${base}/images/council-honor-2024.webp`} width="320" height="568" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          alt="Holding a framed proclamation, she speaks into a microphone in the Waukegan City Council chambers."
          data-i18n-attr="alt:home.excellence.still_alt" />
        <figcaption data-i18n="home.excellence.still_caption">Honored by the City Council, August 2024.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .excellence { background: var(--purple-soft); }
  .ex-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.75fr); gap: var(--space-3xl); align-items: center; }
  .ex-copy .section-title { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; column-gap: 0.25em; }

  .ex-quote { position: relative; margin: var(--space-xl) 0; padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg) calc(var(--space-xl) + 2.4rem); }
  .ex-quote :global(.ex-quote-star) { position: absolute; left: var(--space-lg); top: calc(var(--space-xl) + 0.2rem); width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 0.6px rgba(43, 7, 71, 0.6)); }
  .ex-quote .quote-text { font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--purple); }
  .ex-quote .tr-line { margin-top: var(--space-sm); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .tr-line:empty, :global(html[lang="en"]) .tr-line { display: none; }
  .ex-quote footer { margin-top: var(--space-md); font-family: var(--font-label); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--gold-deep); }
  .ex-p2 { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .ex-visual { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  /* A purple honor tile with gold lines, standing in for the sign */
  .ex-honor {
    position: relative; width: min(320px, 100%); text-align: center; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg) 2.4rem;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--gold), inset 0 0 0 6px var(--purple), inset 0 0 0 7px rgba(254, 198, 10, 0.6), var(--shadow-lg);
  }
  .ex-honor :global(.ex-honor-star) { width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-sm); display: block; }
  .ex-honor-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900; font-size: var(--text-2xl); line-height: 1.05; color: var(--white); margin: 0 auto var(--space-sm); }
  .ex-honor-line { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0 auto; }
  .ex-honor-date { font-family: var(--font-label); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--gold); margin: var(--space-sm) auto 0; }

  /* The council still is low resolution: keep it small */
  .ex-still { width: 190px; aspect-ratio: 320 / 440; margin-top: -14px; margin-left: 150px; border: 5px solid var(--white); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--gold), var(--shadow-lg); transform: rotate(3deg); }
  .ex-still img { object-position: center 30%; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .ex-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-2xl); }
    .ex-still { margin-left: 120px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ex-quote { padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-md) calc(var(--space-lg) + 2rem); }
    .ex-quote :global(.ex-quote-star) { left: var(--space-md); top: calc(var(--space-lg) + 0.2rem); width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; }
    .ex-still { width: 170px; margin-left: 70px; }
  }
</style>
